         "label": "Managed-banner",
         "name": "widget_1758870244695",
         "params": {
          "add_content": "<h1>Flieber Managed Services</h1>\n<h3>Inventory planning, simplified\u2014 without the hassle.</h3>\n<p>Running demand and inventory planning in-house takes time, focus, and expertise. With Flieber Managed Services, you get the best of both worlds: our centralized software solution paired with a dedicated team that co-leads the demand planning process alongside you.</p>\n<p>The result? Lower costs, fewer stockouts and overstocks, and the confidence that your forecasts are as accurate as they can be.</p>",
          "add_image": {
