         "label": "manage-service-box",
         "name": "module_17588746241044",
         "params": {
          "add_content": "<h2>What is Managed Services?</h2>\n<p>Flieber\u2019s Managed Services combines the power of our AI-driven platform with hands-on operational support. While our software automates forecasting, replenishment, and reporting, our team ensures every detail runs smoothly \u2014 from system setup to supplier follow-ups.</p>\n<p>Think of us as an extension of your operations team, taking complexity off your plate so you can focus on what matters most: the growth of your brand.</p>",
          "add_image": {
           "alt": "services-img-1",
           "height": 741,
           "loading": "lazy",
           "max_height": 741,
           "max_width": 700,
           "size_type": "auto",
