         "label": "manage-service-box",
         "name": "module_17588746503754",
         "params": {
          "add_content": "<h2>Why Choose Managed Services?</h2>\n<p>Flieber Managed Services delivers superior value to your business:</p>\n<h4>Increase Sales</h4>\n<p>Meet demand without losing revenue to stockouts.</p>\n<h4>Optimize Capital</h4>\n<p>Free up cash by avoiding unnecessary inventory.</p>\n<h4>Boost Margins</h4>\n<p>Reduce mistakes, cut storage costs, and improve efficiency.</p>\n<h4>Reduce Work</h4>\n<p>No more spreadsheets or firefighting. We handle the heavy lifting.</p>",
