         "params": {
          "add_content": "<h2>The Flieber Advantage</h2>\n<p>By pairing advanced technology with real human expertise, Managed Services gives you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The most modern forecasting models in the market.</li>\n<li>Full visibility into sales and inventory in real time through Flieber\u2019s celebrated interface.</li>\n<li>A partner who co-leads your planning and execution process.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>That\u2019s how we help brands scale with confidence.</p>",
